{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>Who are these men with you?</b> Who are they to you — that you have prepared yourself for prophecy on their behalf, to know what you should do to them? Are they indeed with you as inquirers of the future, desiring to know what will be, so that you may tell them? Or are they with you as ones seeking to attain some purpose through your curse, and your intent now is to ask permission whether you may do their will?"], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:40:39.203612654Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}